#: ../../tools/who_gho_tools.rst:32 f9d2e37db940478091319c170d097a4e
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get actual health data values for a specific WHO Global "
"Health Observatory indicator by its code. Returns country-level data with"
" values, confidence intervals, year, and sex/age breakdowns. No "
"authentication required. Common indicator codes: WHOSIS\\_000001 (life "
"expectancy at birth), MALARIA002 (malaria cases), MDG\\_0000000026 (HIV "
"prevalence), NCD\\_BMI\\_30C (obesity prevalence), SDGPM25 (PM2.5 air "
"pollution), WHS4\\_100 (hospital beds per 10000)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/who_gho_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/who_gho_tools.rst:71
#: 30a0205ebb60459097c50702b060ba13 c273b136958343fc998ab41e711753ca
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/who_gho_tools.rst:36 3091fa70217742d3b655be917c165ade
msgid ""
"``indicator_code`` (string) (required) WHO GHO indicator code. Examples: "
"'WHOSIS\\_000001' (life expectancy), 'MALARIA002' (malaria cases), "
"'MDG\\_0000000026' (HIV prevalence), 'NCD\\_BMI\\_30C' (obesity), "
"'SDGPM25' (air pollution PM2.5), 'WHS4\\_100' (hospital beds)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/who_gho_tools.rst:39 4e045df3a70f4632ad93282be8bd3fe3
msgid ""
"``filter`` (string, null) (optional) OData filter for data rows. "
"Examples: \"SpatialDim eq 'USA'\", \"TimeDim eq 2022\", \"Dim1 eq "
"'SEX\\_FMLE' and TimeDim ge 2015\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/who_gho_tools.rst:42 29b2f3af9ad44eaf9b287705c9229ba6
msgid ""
"``top`` (integer, null) (optional) Maximum number of data rows to return."
" Default: 20"
msgstr ""

